{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7ecde7ae2c8069fe78baba86cd85173ef14a3cfb880da1876f1f8b98fd51e8a6", "ja": "（美希が出るライブの仕事で、地方まで来たけど……\n収録の時間まで、まだ少しあるな）", "zh": "（我陪美希来到其他县市参加演唱会通告……\n不过距离录影开始还有段时间。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1001_p", "source_sha256": "e85c7ef614df3202faff30e5c10097de8d822fc09a4f6c1e320c2609bfaa4515", "ja": "（ちょっとどこかで時間を潰して……ん？\nあれは、弾き語りの……女の子か？）", "zh": "（找个地方消磨时间吧……嗯？\n有人在自弹自唱……是女生吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1002_se", "source_sha256": "96916ae2adcba4380fbc552cad6de0b67edc9063bf81be210049ade1983b4848", "ja": "ポロン……", "zh": "（拨弦声……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1004_se", "source_sha256": "aa5af3351ab9f4fd39c38fbac7897f347dc5f24a319fc861768500d5e6a7c1ad", "ja": "ジャカジャカジャカジャカジャン！", "zh": "铮铮铮铮铮铮铮铮铮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1006_se", "source_sha256": "8227b89d9819821f8500e1a83bb1c4de745549344a9caadae6d41812954ba0ba", "ja": "……ジャカジャーン！", "zh": "……铮铮铮！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1007_050jul", "source_sha256": "fd497fefcaf364093d97a89fc6a29f7eb1e9c1e7cbc69006f57bd4a1a10f95d6", "ja": "っと……。ま、こんなもんかな。", "zh": "好……嗯，大概就这样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1008_050jul", "source_sha256": "1a0ec481a0e2ec9d1f39b790e5bbb7eeb8b220f049e88801ef73864cd88732b5", "ja": "で……、なんだよ、あんた？\nさっきから人のこと、もの珍しそうに見て。", "zh": "呃……这位先生，你有事吗？\n你从刚刚就一直用稀奇的眼光看着我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1009_050jul", "source_sha256": "64d3e888e85eb954b60f753781d620174649e4f8fe8fba461cda843c81e4d5da", "ja": "見た感じ、観光客だよな。あんたの地元じゃ、\n路上ライブをやってるヤツが、そんなに珍しいのか？", "zh": "你看起来应该是观光客？你们那边都没人会在街头演唱？\n有这么稀奇吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1010_p", "source_sha256": "67994c64397fbca4a35be198ddca76f35bb678e29600a00141e3d9793c82026d", "ja": "ああ、ごめん。君の歌と雰囲気に、\nすっかり惹きつけられてしまって、つい……。", "zh": "抱歉，是我的错。因为你的歌声和气质太吸引人了，\n我不小心就……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1011_050jul", "source_sha256": "117fdb67c4b43004e57cfa0fe47fc274cc2d321baa41282230624a8b5518a92d", "ja": "へえ……そう言われると嬉しいね♪\nあたしの歌が、あんたの足を止めさせた、ってコトか。", "zh": "是喔……谢谢你的称赞♪\n你因为我的歌声而停下脚步了，是吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1012_p", "source_sha256": "255316d3146dfa8d6fc11f5b3d51ec06fcee8e6a48071b779015b03ffade3b9b", "ja": "君はソロ活動中？　それともバンドを？\nよかったら、名前を聞かせてくれないか？", "zh": "你是单独活动的吗？还是有组团呢？\n方便的话，能将你的名字告诉我吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1013_050jul", "source_sha256": "b6b7ad8f9a0b65ca8227438dd99aef8357ad814adff592d345cc110ff4892619", "ja": "ああ、いいぜ。あたしの名前はジュリア。", "zh": "好，可以啊。我叫做茱莉亚。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1014_050jul", "source_sha256": "31b98c0b887723435966324177c45f95797c69e39b9ba646df3e271b2ac4a06b", "ja": "前はバンドのボーカリストをやってたけど、\n色々あって解散してさ。ソロでやってる。", "zh": "之前是个乐团的主唱，\n不过发生一些事情就解散了。现在一个人单飞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1015_050jul", "source_sha256": "ca424d169fefee73831a81da6cda26284913ffb2cbe569ba4f774807e7892ea7", "ja": "今はストリートだけど……いつかアーティストとして、\n世界中にあたしの歌を届けたいんだ！", "zh": "虽然现在都在街头表演……但我希望有朝一日\n当上职业音乐人，向全世界唱出我的歌！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1016_p", "source_sha256": "0fbd822faffff199da6afbca2649946b2f405f4bb4f4c5b0590ab8b6cfbbb112", "ja": "（この目の輝き、人を惹きつける雰囲気、そして\nさっきの歌声。この子なら、きっと……！）", "zh": "（眼里的闪耀光芒、引人注目的气质、\n还有刚才的歌声。这女孩一定可以……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_1017", "source_sha256": "af64cb5745e12f46015965a25065eec951dbf0fe41fc1cee6cc18e96b64fe4f6", "ja": "名刺を取り出す", "zh": "拿出名片", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2000_p", "source_sha256": "6b9ace9fc567b5fbb60d34c226ca233b12e85f084fb02d06ae9c97fffeac1d63", "ja": "その夢、俺と一緒に目指さないか？\n実は俺、プロデューサーをやってるんだ。", "zh": "要不要和我一起朝你的梦想迈进呢？\n不瞒你说，我是个制作人。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2001_050jul", "source_sha256": "3ebc9d5bc1ffa8bbd13e5be7e98c84cf21b9bd31fddb49c15a7f89405b63e318", "ja": "それ……あたしをスカウトしたいってことか？", "zh": "你拿名片出来……是要挖角我的意思吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2002_p", "source_sha256": "d85cbef4bc3957c8685922a56d24cf7fccac76fa3957051c57661f84b5911de9", "ja": "そういうこと。\nよかったら、詳しい話を……", "zh": "正是如此。\n不介意的话，让我详细说明……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2003_050jul", "source_sha256": "38f895738549840c1badfa337bbe25f509d4da58437dd4f75e6e0cf6890945f2", "ja": "あははっ、冗談！\n話なんて、聞くまでもないね。", "zh": "哈哈哈！开什么玩笑！\n根本就不需要听什么说明。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2004_050jul", "source_sha256": "abfab908d0cfe407d4884500cebab0e240b9caa4d1b8aee675dd674c2940d044", "ja": "あたしは世界を目指してるんだ。\nで、あんたは、あたしを見つけてくれた……。", "zh": "我的目标是全世界。\n而你正好出现找到了我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2005_050jul", "source_sha256": "318fa9443476db74f8b8f94eccdbe585adf4f7f6bf57bfe89214ca618b33f708", "ja": "いいぜ、一緒に連れてってやる！", "zh": "好啊，我就带你一起去吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2006_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2007_p", "source_sha256": "fb7501bad3a162a090c8fcf6fe42ffcb6f0f59b168945d9f6b3608240807b96d", "ja": "（あれからしばらくして、ジュリアは上京。\n765プロに来てくれたが……）", "zh": "（过了一段时间后，茱莉亚来到东京。\n她造访了765艺能，但……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2008_050jul", "source_sha256": "bb984ffd47041d7c6b278170d9ea0f373bb1f4874efe4b11f3b906e57bc7e07e", "ja": "あ、アイドルぅ！？　スカウトしてくれたのって、\nロック歌手じゃなくて、アイドルだったのか！？", "zh": "偶、偶像！？所以你不是要挖角我来当摇滚歌手，\n而是要当偶像吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2009_p", "source_sha256": "7b872d5af949bbcbc67fe728a3eff428633ec2e57adf8563dd3ca128ae264329", "ja": "ご、ごめん。やっぱり、\nちゃんと説明すればよかったな。", "zh": "抱、抱歉，\n我当时应该要说明清楚一点的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2010_050jul", "source_sha256": "8a805807a2901a7c943314f2165048cee405c642b220df85efb5df2180abc211", "ja": "マジか……。くぅ、あたしとしたことが！\n何でまた、そんな……！", "zh": "真的假的……唔～我怎么这么笨！\n为什么又这样……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2011_p", "source_sha256": "105b0e6ec5d9b056c51a32376a9579cb77903baed7c851a77830d64c48b2fccf", "ja": "その……どうする？　やっぱりやめるか……？", "zh": "请问……你打算怎么办？想必是不会答应吧……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2012_050jul", "source_sha256": "1c341d13b332482f7de48705f1b587d76361c3b0398b2192985d0fe71cfc47de", "ja": "ん～～～～～……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2013_050jul", "source_sha256": "fc5878b535b237ed2e5264d4c9e20341fa754f1812226892fa1039b81cddb2f4", "ja": "いや。浮かれてろくに話も聞かなかった、\nあたしも悪かった。", "zh": "不，是我得意过头，没有听你的说明，\n我自己也有错。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2014_050jul", "source_sha256": "e0f550c54e390f9aba02871e7ecec0e3a0a6adfec515e6c2e2469d6ef75d560b", "ja": "それに、一度やると言ったからには、\nそれを貫き通すのがあたしの流儀だ。", "zh": "而且，我的原则就是，\n答应的事情就要贯彻到底。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2015_p", "source_sha256": "26a8743102010a21c96cd817eeef20e34e0f0855644fa694e06b727f3c787a6e", "ja": "つまり……。", "zh": "这么说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2016_050jul", "source_sha256": "6cd5e119d47d253b69edc2ada2b7b0d810b95f07ebc48bea70a1b8f517ff6c7f", "ja": "アイドル、やってみるよ。\nこれからよろしくな！", "zh": "我会尝试做做看偶像。\n以后还请多指教啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2017_p", "source_sha256": "860ea3269d9b1440e5162e8c3e710fad916107fa92b364a0a2744c7bd41227a8", "ja": "ありがとう、ジュリア！\nこれからよろしく！", "zh": "谢谢你，茱莉亚！\n以后请多指教了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_050jul_001_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_050jul_001_2018_p", "source_sha256": "3f0d7446bd4b860174652a263ba8c2bdb24199a20b881ca030f206a72c030d7b", "ja": "（気持ちの整理はつけてくれたらしい。\n彼女の夢を叶えるため、アイドルで世界を目指そう！）", "zh": "（她似乎已经准备好要面对了。\n为了实现她的梦想，就以偶像身分迈向全世界吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
